<details class="source-notes" id="method">
  <summary>About the data</summary>
  <p>Green changes compare collection totals with the previous day (PT), including newly added references. They are not daily site traffic or same-post growth.</p>
  <p>Each video's statistics snapshot date (PT) is shown in its details. Unavailable counts appear as —. Impressions measure post exposure, not video plays. △ marks plays below 3% of impressions; the cause is unverified.</p>
  <p>High-resolution reference files, with each file’s actual resolution in its details. Eight are excerpts, labeled with the original duration. Style notes use sampled frames.</p>
